Thought: Test a robust softmax‑based weighting on the full pool to see if it can beat the current dba leader on this highly seasonal, unstable ranking series.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: The series has unstable rankings and strong seasonality; a per‑horizon best model weighting could capture changing strengths across the 8‑step horizon.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"best_per_horizon"}

Thought: Test a weighted blend on the smaller, more stable pool4 using softmax_neg_error to see if a softer weighting improves over the hard DBA baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

